'''Còrdova''' (from [[W:Phoenician language|Phoenician]]-[[W:Punic language|Punic]] ''qart ṭūbah;'' meaning 'good town'), is the historic capital of the [[Araucaria|Hesperia community]]. In the [[2025 Baliscan census|2025 census]], the communal population was 903,664 people, making it the sixteenth most populous in [[Baliscan Confederation|Balisca]]. 

